   "x": 430,
   "y": 430,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "youtube-reporting-ingest  (new)\nCloud Scheduler 08:00 + 14:00 Phoenix\nREPORTING_ENABLED kill switch\n\nlists every retained report each run,\ndiffs against the ledger (no watermark),\nnewest generation per day wins,\nheader-only report never deletes,\narchive to GCS BEFORE parsing",
