   "text": "youtube_analytics: 4 original tables\nvideo_metadata, daily_video_stats\n(snapshot_date), daily_video_analytics,\ndaily_traffic_sources (activity_date)\n\nDELETE then load, keyed on activity_date,\nrefuses to delete on zero rows\nload_source: cron | backfill | recovery | gap_repair\n2026-08-11 recovered today: 118 traffic rows",
