   "type": "text",
   "id": "rep_t",
   "x": 910,
   "y": 430,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "19 reporting_* tables + reporting_ingest_ledger\nschemas GENERATED from report_specs.py\nPARTITION BY report_date, CLUSTER BY video_id\nprovenance: report_id, create_time, job_id,\nload_source, ingested_at\n\n3 types hold data (reach, basic, traffic):\n136 reports, 27,756 rows, 0 failed\n16 types fill from about 2026-09-07\nviews = first-frame plays since 2026-08-24;\nengaged_views = the old definition",
   "originalText": "19 reporting_* tables + reporting_ingest_ledger\nschemas GENERATED from report_specs.py\nPARTITION BY report_date, CLUSTER BY video_id\nprovenance: report_id, create_time, job_id,\nload_source, ingested_at\n\n3 types hold data (reach, basic, traffic):\n136 reports, 27,756 rows, 0 failed\n16 types fill from about 2026-09-07\nviews = first-frame plays since 2026-08-24;\nengaged_views = the old definition",
