  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "views_t",
   "x": 1390,
   "y": 170,
   "width": 325,
   "height": 500,
   "text": "sql/views/  (new, staging only)\n\nvideo_current  (one row per video)\ntraffic_source_type_lookup  (24 codes)\nvideo_daily_funnel\n  impressions > clicks > views > watch time\n  AVD = watch time / ENGAGED views (Studio's rule)\nvideo_audience_growth\n  non-subscriber share, subs per 1k views\nvideo_traffic_detail_daily\n  search terms, suggested-from, referrers\nvideo_ctr_by_surface_daily\nchannel_device_mix_daily\nvideo_end_screen_daily\nvideo_cards_daily\nchannel_sharing_daily\nchannel_demographics\nchannel_daily_summary\n  calendar 7 / 28 day windows\n\nrules: aggregate to grain BEFORE join,\nratios recomputed from totals,\n0 when the report exists, NULL when not,\nevery ratio on views AND engaged views:\n`view` changed meaning 2026-08-24,\nengaged_views is the stable series",
   "originalText": "sql/views/  (new, staging only)\n\nvideo_current  (one row per video)\ntraffic_source_type_lookup  (24 codes)\nvideo_daily_funnel\n  impressions > clicks > views > watch time\n  AVD = watch time / ENGAGED views (Studio's rule)\nvideo_audience_growth\n  non-subscriber share, subs per 1k views\nvideo_traffic_detail_daily\n  search terms, suggested-from, referrers\nvideo_ctr_by_surface_daily\nchannel_device_mix_daily\nvideo_end_screen_daily\nvideo_cards_daily\nchannel_sharing_daily\nchannel_demographics\nchannel_daily_summary\n  calendar 7 / 28 day windows\n\nrules: aggregate to grain BEFORE join,\nratios recomputed from totals,\n0 when the report exists, NULL when not,\nevery ratio on views AND engaged views:\n`view` changed meaning 2026-08-24,\nengaged_views is the stable series",
