  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "next_t",
   "x": 1380,
   "y": 870,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "Phase 1 parity after tonight's 00:10 run\n3-day staging soak, structural checks once\n  the 16 new report types have data\nStudio spot-check (Kyle)\nsnapshot the 4 prod tables\napply DDL, deploy both functions to prod\n  (Reporting kill switch off, then on)\nbackfill prod from the GCS archive\nscheduler + alerts without -staging suffix\nverify_reporting + verify_views on prod\n\nPhase 4 afterwards: traffic gap repair,\ntransactional writer for the 4 tables,\nexpiry/growth tripwires, missing-run alert",
   "originalText": "Phase 1 parity after tonight's 00:10 run\n3-day staging soak, structural checks once\n  the 16 new report types have data\nStudio spot-check (Kyle)\nsnapshot the 4 prod tables\napply DDL, deploy both functions to prod\n  (Reporting kill switch off, then on)\nbackfill prod from the GCS archive\nscheduler + alerts without -staging suffix\nverify_reporting + verify_views on prod\n\nPhase 4 afterwards: traffic gap repair,\ntransactional writer for the 4 tables,\nexpiry/growth tripwires, missing-run alert",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
